<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/5/eng@/~cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in Clause (2)— “(aa) the Chief Judge of the High Court in Malaya; (ab) the Chief Judge of the High Court in Sabah and Sarawak;”; “(b) the Attorney General, provided that he is not a member of Parliament;”; “(ba) the Public Prosecutor; (bb) the Solicitor General; and”; and “(c) a member who shall be appointed by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong in his discretion, after consultation with the Chief Justice of the Federal Court, from among persons who are or have been or are qualified to be a judge of the Federal Court, Court of Appeal or a High Court.”. Amendment of Article 145"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/5/eng@> .
